### 1. Tampil semua
GET http://localhost:3000/api/mahasiswa

### 2. Tambah data
POST http://localhost:3000/api/mahasiswa
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nim": "2026003",
  "nama": "Citra",
  "prodi": "Teknik Informatika"
}

### 3. Detail by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/mahasiswa/1

### 4. Ubah data
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/mahasiswa/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Andi Baru"
}

### 5. Hapus data
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/mahasiswa/2

### 6. Data tidak ditemukan
GET http://localhost:3000/api/mahasiswa/99